WEBVTT

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.230
What was that anyway?

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.770
I don't know popo.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.860
I felt a strong force.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.130
Senior?

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.880
That was a part of the Power of Creation.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.770
The Power of Creation?

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:43.550
A portion of the Power of Creation 
inside Pollun burst out.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.760
The Power of Creation...

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.030
...burst out?

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.670
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.430
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:00.910
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.610
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.350
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:12.350
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.150
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.960
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:21.930
<i>we both</i>

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.260
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:25.830
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.830
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:32.400
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.570
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:38.140
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:44.320
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.620
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:48.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.120
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:55.390
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:58.460
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.200
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:11.580
Stop crowding me!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.600
So the Power of Annihilation 
will eventually...

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.650
That's right... it'll eat 
away at us from the inside.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:21.050
After all, we're a part of Jyaku-King.

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:24.830
Does that mean that we have no choice, 
but to wait for it to destroy us?

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.530
If you don't want that to 
happen, what will you do?

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:33.670
We have to get a hold of the Power 
of Creation as soon as possible.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.130
Huh?

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:38.350
We have to get a hold of 
the Power of Creation!

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:39.940
That's right.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.560
All living things live for 
the sake of themselves.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.380
For their own happiness...

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.190
They act only to fulfill their own desires.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.450
In other words...

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.020
In other words...?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:52.950
In other words!

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.530
We will get the Power of Creation.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:01.430
But it's not for the sake of Jyaku-King 
or for the sake of Dotsuku Zone...

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.630
Then for whose sake is it?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.330
For us...

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.080
For our own sakes!

00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:10.600
Are you prepared?

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:15.620
It's flying...

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.350
How nice...

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.010
It's for our freedom...

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.940
For our eternal life.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.450
We'll start by burying those two in darkness.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.620
Let me out instead of the cockatoo!

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:39.630
"WE ARE ONE! NAGISA AND 
HONOKA'S POWERFUL BOND"

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.620
But, for a while, I didn't 
know what would happen.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.080
You're right... Absolutely right.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.640
To be honest, I thought we had lost.

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:50.740
Wining or losing isn't everything.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.610
What do you mean?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:57.850
It's not only in lacrosse, 
but in life, too, isn't it?

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:01.620
I realized it after I went out in the world.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.890
What did you realize?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.190
I don't understand!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.060
Then, tell me... What's important to you?

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.380
I don't know...

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:14.470
Come to think of it, I've never 
thought about things like that..

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.200
The Field of Light and 
the Field of Rainbows...

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.340
Huh?

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.810
I mean... It's love, isn't it?

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.410
Who are you talking about?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.840
No one in particular...

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.750
You just thought of someone, didn't you?

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.110
No, I didn't! You're imagining things.

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:35.530
Love...?

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:36.950
Peace...

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.340
And friends...

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.680
Family?

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.360
Chocolate is important 
to you, isn't it, Nagisa?

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.630
That's true.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.830
This is hopeless.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.820
Then what's most important to you, Akane-san?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.050
Come to think of it... 
 What's important to me...?

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.340
Thanks for waiting, Nagisa.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.780
Honoka!

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.140
Yukishiro-san...

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:00.310
What's important to you?

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.180
What's important to me...?

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.210
I guess it would be water.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:08.130
Humans are made up of 70 percent water.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.500
Then it would be the protein 
that builds your body...

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.370
The amino acids that it's based on...

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.450
And the carbohydrates that's 
the source of energy.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:18.260
But the human will to live is awesome.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.860
According to one theory, 
an adult female can live

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.600
for two months on just water alone.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:27.940
Shall we go home?

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:29.920
We have homework to do.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:32.160
Thank you for the meal, Akane-san.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.500
Thanks!

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.070
Isn't that what they wanted to hear?

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.370
Was I off the mark?

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.620
I thought it was interesting...

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.120
You really tried hard.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.320
You're so mean.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.390
I'll start mipo.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.090
Start with "a" mipo.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.580
Ice cream (aisu kurimu) mepo.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.640
Let's see... "Po"? Potato fry mipo.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.160
Isn't it "mu"?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.560
Po... po... I pass popo.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.040
Potato gratin mepo.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.260
"N" usually ends the game, but...

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.280
"Po"? Pollun mipo.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.580
Pollun is my word popo!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.310
That's not fair popo! That's not fair popo!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.770
There he goes again mepo.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.350
Come to think of it, I haven't 
really thought about it.

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.020
Thought about what?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.840
What's most important to me...

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:18.240
That's really difficult, isn't it?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.260
We'll know what it is eventually.

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.490
I wonder...

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:22.560
Po!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:24.660
Mepo!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:25.400
Mipo!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.900
Popo... popo...!

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.270
It's pitch black popo!

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.140
I'm afraid of the dark popo...

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.670
It's time to put an end to this.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.190
You'd better be prepared!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.660
Transform mepo!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:59.260
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.610
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.210
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.980
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.250
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:24.690
Go back to where you came from!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.350
White...

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.570
Your weakness is...

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:43.060
...that you can't do anything alone.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.450
Zakenna!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.330
White!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.770
Zakenna!

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.750
Black!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.330
White...!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.300
You two are separated now.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:09.270
Now that you're separated, 
you have no power at all.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.600
White!

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.500
Where am I?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.810
Welcome to the world of darkness.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.190
The world of darkness...?

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:34.380
Mipple!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.560
The power of darkness is too strong here...

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.530
It's hard to breathe mipo...

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:41.070
The strength is draining 
out of my body mipo...

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:44.010
This place is overflowing 
with the power of darkness.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:47.610
I'm sure someone from the Field of Light 
won't be able to bear it... Can you?

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.810
Hang on, Mipple!

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:53.760
Once you're separated, you're both powerless.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.750
You'll be swallowed up by the darkness...

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.820
You can just rot away here.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.860
Neither of you can do anything alone, so

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:08.460
she's desperately looking for you.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.420
She pretends to look for her partner, but

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:14.380
all she wants to do is reassure 
herself that she's not powerless.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:18.790
In the end, even you are 
only thinking of yourself.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:22.370
That's right... it's all for your own sake.

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.320
It's only for your own sake.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.190
White!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.440
Where are you?

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.260
Where are you, White?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:48.210
The power of darkness is 
getting stronger mepo.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.450
She must be somewhere near here mepo.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.900
White! Where are you, White?

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.490
Black! Calm down mepo!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.910
Calm down, and try to feel 
White's presence mepo.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.970
I don't blame you...

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:03.610
Up until now, the two of 
you have fought together,

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:05.690
but now you're separated.

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:06.950
You're feeling uneasy, aren't you?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.360
You're afraid, aren't you?

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:12.360
After all, neither one of 
you can do anything alone.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.830
Stop! Stop it!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:18.560
Black! Don't listen to 
what she's saying mepo!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:20.970
She's just trying to make you uneasy mepo!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.180
That's why I said...

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.000
Now that you're separated, 
you're of no use at all.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.940
Stop it already!

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.210
Are you okay, Mipple?

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.600
Mipple?

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:42.320
It's no use mipo...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.790
Don't say that...

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.090
I'm sorry, White.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:50.990
Pull yourself together, 
Mipple! Don't leave me alone.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.880
You're the Princess of Hope, aren't you?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.170
Mipple!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.160
Mipple...

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.600
You're separated... Separated...

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.710
Separated...

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:12.500
Where are you, White?

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.360
Where did you go?

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.440
I'm no good alone, after all.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:21.000
What are you saying mepo? 
It's not like you mepo.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.060
But... it's always been the two of us.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:26.600
It's impossible with just my strength alone.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.800
It was always the two of us...

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:31.770
She encouraged me so many times.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:36.230
Just being without White, I feel so unsure...

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.660
It can't be!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.150
That's your fate...

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:53.390
Everything will be swallowed by darkness, 
and there won't be anything left of you.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.030
Friends (tomodaCHI)...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.180
Cheesecake mepo...

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.350
Post...

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.960
Tomato mepo...

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:05.840
Poplar (popura)...

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:07.690
Ramen mepo...

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:10.000
Po... po...

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.370
You can use "ho" mepo...

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.010
Ho... Ho...

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:19.750
Honoka... That's right.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.150
I have to find Honoka.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.280
There's nowhere to go...

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:34.200
There's nowhere you can run.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.180
Where's Honoka?

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.320
Forget about her!

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.640
She should be swallowed up by darkness now.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.370
Eventually, there won't 
be anything left of her...

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.410
And she'll disappear.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.610
You mean Honoka...?

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:51.880
Are you talking about Honoka?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.690
You should disappear, too!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.890
Zakenna!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.740
If anything happens to Honoka, 
you won't get away with it!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.450
It's close... It's close by mipo.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.040
Hope... hope is near...

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.720
Does... does that mean...?

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.410
Nagisa!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.520
Honoka!

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:41.210
Popo?

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:46.350
Pull yourself together mepo!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.570
They're right down here mepo.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:52.740
Even if they are, do you have 
the power to move forward?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.710
Honoka...?

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.060
Hang on, Mipple.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.150
Nagisa will be here soon.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.460
Stop that!

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.320
Get away!

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:05.640
Hang on, Mipple!

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:08.240
It's not like us to give up hope, is it?

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:11.970
Thank you, White... Are you okay, White?

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:19.240
I'm okay... I can still feel warmth.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.040
You're just trying to reassure 
yourself that you're not powerless.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.270
You're separated now.

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.870
Do you have the power...?

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:28.680
It's all for your own sake.

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.900
Stop taking me for a fool!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.300
Separated?

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.610
We can't do anything alone...?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.340
Of course we can't!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.260
We are all alone to begin with...

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.920
What's wrong with looking 
for Honoka for my own sake?

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:46.500
Why is it wrong to care about myself?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.620
Even if I can't do anything alone,

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.650
there are a lot of things that I can do.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:55.170
What's wrong with something 
as obvious as that?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.580
Honoka!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.450
Zakenna!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.760
Don't get in my way!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.200
Out of my way!

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.860
I won't let you go any further.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.680
Get... away from there!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:38.920
Nagisa!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:40.790
Honoka?

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.200
Honoka?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.400
Nagisa...

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.830
Honoka!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.460
You're not hurt, are you? 
You're okay, aren't you?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.690
I'm so glad.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.900
I looked all over for you.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.760
Now... now...

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:57.120
Don't give me that!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:01.750
Do you know how worried I was?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.940
If I hadn't come, you'd be...

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.910
Are you really okay?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.180
Thanks to you, Nagisa.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:21.520
You really took us for fools, didn't you?

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:28.990
This time I absolutely won't forgive you!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:38.640
You don't want us to get serious.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:17.960
They're strong, after all.

